SUMMARY:Layne Staley Tribute East 2026
LOCATION:Crystal Ballroom\, 55 Davis Square\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Layne Staley Tribute East returns following a powerful inaugura
 l year as a nonprofit concert honoring the legacies of Layne Staley and Mi
 ke Starr while raising awareness and support for those affected by addicti
 on. Modeled after the long-running Seattle Layne Staley Tribute\, now in i
 ts 24th year\, this event carries that legacy forward on the East Coast th
 rough an unforgettable night of music\, remembrance\, and purpose. More th
 an a concert\, Layne Staley Tribute East is a mission-driven experience br
 inging together musicians and fans to celebrate the music and impact of La
 yne and Mike. Built on authenticity\, community\, and deep respect for the
  legacy it represents\, the show transforms remembrance into action. Proce
 eds will support musicians struggling with fentanyl and opioid addiction a
 nd provide resources for their families through donations to the Layne Sta
 ley Memorial Fund via Therapeutic Health Services (THS) in Seattle and the
  CASPAR Men's Recovery Home in Somerville\, MA.\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.
 com/layne-staley-tribute-east-2026-somerville-massachusetts-11-07-2026/eve
 nt/010064A53AB50B9D\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/layne-staley-tribute-east-2026-somerville-
 massachusetts-11-07-2026/event/010064A53AB50B9D
END:VEVENT
